  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Elections for Ethiopia&#x2019;s Democracy Strengthening (SEEDS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ethiopian political landscape has witnessed dramatic changes. It is expected that the 2020 general elections will greatly depart from previous elections by witnessings true and effective political competition. The project&apos;s objective is to build the capacity of the electoral management body, the National Electoral Board of Ethiopia (NEBE), by helping it become a more capable, transparent and trusted institution. The project will provide the assistance necessary for undertaking the elections.</narrative>
  </description>
